This repository vendors the inference-only `fireredtts2` Python package from
FireRedTTS-2, upstream commit 404f3f61d25bb4804859b588a6a734bf8468090c:
https://github.com/FireRedTeam/FireRedTTS2
FireRedTTS-2 is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The upstream source is
unmodified except for adding fireredtts2/utils/__init__.py so standard Python
packaging includes that module.

The default model checkpoint is hosted separately at:
https://huggingface.co/llm-jp/zoom1-dialogue-tts

The existing S1 speaker prompt is distributed as references/turn000_S1.wav.
Use it only within the permission applicable to that recording; code licensing
does not grant rights to model weights or reference audio.
